      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport sys\n\nimport cowsay\n\nif len(sys.argv) != 2:\n    sys.exit(\"Usage: python cozum.py NAME\")\n\ncowsay.cow(f\"hello, {sys.argv[1]}\")\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport sys\n\nimport cowsay\n\nif len(sys.argv) != 2:\n    sys.exit(\"Usage: python cozum.py NAME\")\n\ncowsay.cow(f\"hello, {sys.argv[1]}\")\n```"
    }
  ],
